<TestCaseEntity>
   <description>Test: CSVFile - Save
Requirement: OO IE Docker installed, encrypted connection with PowerFolder Server
Steps: Type a line, save (Ctrl/Cmd+S) and close the editor; reopen the file, type a second line without saving, wait for the auto-save status and leave the editor
Expected: The file is successfully saved: PowerFolder stores a new version after each step and the downloaded file contains both lines</description>
